@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #486777
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EEF5FA
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #486777
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F7FAFC
skinparam packageBorderColor #486777
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EEF5FA
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DA
skinparam noteBorderColor #B59865
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam padding 8
title DFD — logical information ownership
left to right direction
usecase "F01\nEstablish identity and enforce scoped authority" as F01
database "D1 Identity / scoped grants" as D1
D1 --> F01 : I1a current context
F01 --> D1 : I1b authorized confirmed change
usecase "F02\nMaintain independent professional presentation" as F02
database "D2 Professional content / publications" as D2
D2 --> F02 : I2a current context
F02 --> D2 : I2b authorized confirmed change
usecase "F03\nGenerate PDFs and disclose selected material" as F03
database "D3 Representation / sharing context" as D3
D3 --> F03 : I3a current context
F03 --> D3 : I3b authorized confirmed change
usecase "F04\nManage manual applications and actual history" as F04
database "D4 Applications / submitted history" as D4
D4 --> F04 : I4a current context
F04 --> D4 : I4b authorized confirmed change
usecase "F05\nCoordinate authorized mail and calendar" as F05
database "D5 Communication / calendar mappings" as D5
D5 --> F05 : I5a current context
F05 --> D5 : I5b authorized confirmed change
usecase "F06\nOrganize work and collaboration" as F06
database "D6 Work / Sprint planning" as D6
D6 --> F06 : I6a current context
F06 --> D6 : I6b authorized confirmed change
usecase "F07\nHost real Git and repository collaboration" as F07
database "D7 Repositories / review context" as D7
D7 --> F07 : I7a current context
F07 --> D7 : I7b authorized confirmed change
usecase "F08\nAdmit conditional execution and separate deployment" as F08
database "D8 Attempts / artifacts / target evidence" as D8
D8 --> F08 : I8a current context
F08 --> D8 : I8b authorized confirmed change
usecase "F09\nAdminister files, policy and recoverable operation" as F09
database "D9 Policy / files / recovery evidence" as D9
D9 --> F09 : I9a current context
F09 --> D9 : I9b authorized confirmed change
legend bottom
Stores are logical information groups, not databases. Read/write does not grant access; unknown effects require reconciliation.
endlegend
@enduml
